1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:01,519
Think you own your home?

2
00:00:02,139 --> 00:00:03,519
Your cat disagrees.

3
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:05,039
They claim your chair,

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,839
inspect every box,

5
00:00:07,259 --> 00:00:09,479
and demand rent—in treats.

6
00:00:10,079 --> 00:00:12,079
And honestly? We’re happy to pay.
